WEBVTT

00:12:58.924 --> 00:13:00.075
KKM: Joj ...

00:13:00.099 --> 00:13:02.284
(Aplavz)

00:13:04.033 --> 00:13:07.911
In to ustvari prostor,
da moja ženstvenost vzcveti,

00:13:07.935 --> 00:13:11.140
kot še nikoli prej.

00:13:12.042 --> 00:13:15.692
Moja seksualnost ga nikoli ne ogroža,

00:13:15.716 --> 00:13:18.879
nikoli ne ukazuje, kaj naj oblečem,
ali kako naj se vedem.

00:13:19.696 --> 00:13:22.890
Kuham jaz ampak on veliko več čisti.

00:13:22.914 --> 00:13:25.106
In kadar se nama mudi iz hiše

00:13:25.130 --> 00:13:26.632
in imava toliko za opraviti,

00:13:26.656 --> 00:13:28.243
on opravi vse,

00:13:28.243 --> 00:13:30.480
zato da imam čas za ličenje
in urejanje frizure.